# Input

```scss
$gap:8px;
$x:[1/* left */ </* right */2,-/* minus */$gap/* before comma */,/* after comma */not/* boolean */false,/* final */];
$y:[+/* plus */$gap];
$z:[1/* final left */</* final right */2];
.comments-boundaries{values:$x;plus:$y;comparison:$z;}

```


# Formatted

```scss
$gap: 8px;
$x: [
	1 /* left */ < /* right */ 2, -/* minus */ $gap /* before comma */, /* after comma */
	not /* boolean */ false, /* final */];
$y: [+/* plus */ $gap];
$z: [1 /* final left */ < /* final right */ 2];
.comments-boundaries {
	values: $x;
	plus: $y;
	comparison: $z;
}

```

# Lines exceeding max width of 80 characters
```
    3: 	1 /* left */ < /* right */ 2, -/* minus */ $gap /* before comma */, /* after comma */
```
